WEBVTT

00:16:01.316 --> 00:16:02.556
I'm not sure.

00:16:02.596 --> 00:16:05.436
DHP: Well, then let me tell you.

00:16:06.276 --> 00:16:08.716
(Laughs)

00:16:08.716 --> 00:16:12.276
I think that the lesson is to ...

00:16:13.076 --> 00:16:14.516
Next time, speak up.

00:16:15.516 --> 00:16:16.676
Next time, speak up.

00:16:16.676 --> 00:16:20.556
Next time when you are at a juncture,

00:16:20.556 --> 00:16:22.276
"Should I speak up or not,"

00:16:22.316 --> 00:16:23.676
think about this.

00:16:24.116 --> 00:16:25.756
Think about this and speak up.

00:16:26.276 --> 00:16:29.156
Do you have any kind of work meetings
or anything coming on

00:16:29.196 --> 00:16:31.556
where you're going to be
confronted with this?